        "question_type": "Objective",
        "exam_year": "2016",
        "question_text": "<p>Under the <b>straight-line method</b> of depreciation, the annual depreciation charge is calculated as:</p>",
        "question_image": null,
        "answer_image": null,
        "explanation": "<p>The straight-line method calculates depreciation as: <br><b>Annual Depreciation = (Cost - Residual Value) / Useful Life</b>. This method spreads the cost evenly over the asset's useful life.</p>",
