        "question_text": "<p>The <b>current ratio</b> is calculated as:</p>",
        "question_image": null,
        "answer_image": null,
        "explanation": "<p>The <i>current ratio</i> measures liquidity and is calculated as: <br><b>Current Ratio = Current Assets / Current Liabilities</b>. It indicates a company's ability to pay short-term obligations.</p>",
